            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ECSP Manager 17.0.0-beta.1 is out \u0026#127881;                                                                                                                                                 \n                                                                                                                                                                                      \n  The major version now aligns with Umbraco CMS \u2014 so v17 targets Umbraco 17\u002B. If you\u0026#39;re on Umbraco 13\u201316, stay on the 3.x releases.                                                   \n\n  New: Import CSP policies in one click\n  Paste a raw Content-Security-Policy header string, preview the directives, and import everything at once. No more recreating policies by hand.\n\n  New: uSync Publisher support\n  Umbraco.Community.CSPManager.uSync.Complete is a brand new package \u2014 push and pull CSP policies between Umbraco instances directly from the backoffice using the standard uSync     \n  Publisher workflow.\n\n  The backoffice has been updated for Umbraco 17 with tree navigation and change tracking \u2014 unsaved changes are detected before you navigate away.\n\n  Under the hood: fully async ICspService, expanded test suite (71 tests, up from 42), and test reports published on every PR.\n\n  Breaking changes to be aware of:\n  - GetOrCreateCspScriptNonce / GetOrCreateCspStyleNonce replaced by a single GetOrCreateCspNonce\n  - CspManagerContext.ScriptNonce / StyleNonce replaced by a single Nonce\n  - Constants.PluginAlias removed \u2014 use Constants.PackageAlias\n  - ICspService has a new GetCspDefinitionAsync(Guid, CancellationToken) \u2014 implement it if you have a custom ICspService\n\n  Three packages, one mono repo, all on NuGet:\n  - https://www.nuget.org/packages/Umbraco.Community.CSPManager/17.0.0-beta.1\n  - https://www.nuget.org/packages/Umbraco.Community.CSPManager.uSync/17.0.0-beta.4\n  - https://www.nuget.org/packages/Umbraco.Community.CSPManager.uSync.Complete/\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://discord.com/channels/869656431308189746/882981290662580264/1491190165157187724\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
